        "startingPosition": "Lie sideways with your hips at the edge of a flat bench, your lower body supported on the bench, and your upper torso extending beyond the edge. Have a partner secure your legs and cross your arms over your chest.",
        "movement": "Bring the unsupported torso into a straight horizontal line with the hips and hold without bending or rotating.",
        "endpoint": "Maintain the horizontal lateral hold for the set time.",
        "controlledJoints": "Keep the spine, pelvis, and hips still while the torso remains unsupported.",
        "supportAndPosture": "Keep the lower body fixed by the partner and do not use an arm to support the torso.",
